    "splashDescription": "The RabbitMQ Connector combines Camunda's best-of-breed process orchestration capabilities with RabbitMQ's robust messaging framework. This Connector is ideal for real-time processing, task synchronization, and seamless multi-system communications. You can use this Connector to integrate reliable messaging into automated processes, thereby offering both flexibility and scalability.",
